{"id":"A2-L027","title":"Verb + -ing: form","cefr":"A2","level":"A2","unit":"A2-U02","focus":"Verb + -ing — forma","targets":{"grammar":"Verb + -ing — forma","pron":"Terminações do passado /t/ /d/ /ɪd/","verbs":[],"pv":[],"expr":[],"words":["renovate","reopen","sandbox","footpath","sculpture","construction","cement","scaffolding","tulips","flowerbed","bandstand","ice cream cart","pavilion","paved","volunteer crew","ribbon cutting"],"field":"Compras","genre":"Notícia / reportagem curta","skill":"Leitura","words_min":16},"frames":[{"tag":"Abertura","title":"Lesson 27 · Verb + -ing: form","blocks":[{"type":"box","kind":"look","t":"Nesta aula","body":["**Foco:** Verb + -ing — forma.","**Pronúncia:** Terminações do passado /t/ /d/ /ɪd/.","**16 palavras novas** (compras).","**Texto do dia:** notícia / reportagem curta."]},{"type":"p","t":"**Objetivo de comunicação (A2):** eu consigo usar verbos seguidos de -ing numa notícia sobre lazer."},{"type":"box","kind":"exam","t":"Ponte para as provas","body":["Você começa a praticar tarefas curtas no formato das provas.","Esta aula treina **ler textos curtos e achar informação (IELTS Reading, TOEFL Reading)**."]}]},{"tag":"Aquecimento","title":"Warm-up · Say the words","blocks":[{"type":"p","t":"Toque em 🔊, ouça e repita cada palavra. Depois tente adivinhar o sentido."},{"type":"words","items":[["renovate","reformar"],["reopen","reabrir"],["sandbox","caixa de areia"],["footpath","trilha"],["sculpture","escultura"],["construction","construction"],["cement","cement"],["scaffolding","scaffolding"],["tulips","tulips"],["flowerbed","flowerbed"],["bandstand","bandstand"],["ice cream cart","ice cream cart"],["pavilion","pavilion"],["paved","paved"],["volunteer crew","volunteer crew"],["ribbon cutting","ribbon cutting"]]}]},{"tag":"Leitura","title":"Reading · A news report","blocks":[{"type":"news","headline":"City Park Reopens After Repairs","paras":["Locals **enjoy walking** again in City Park, which reopened on Monday. Joggers **keep running** along the lake, and children **love playing** on the new swings.","The mayor **suggested putting** more benches. “People **avoid sitting** on broken ones,” she said. Cafés near the gate **finished renovating** last week."],"kicker":"LOCAL NEWS","by":"By Rae Holt","gloss":[["swing","balanço"],["bench","banco (praça)"],["jogger","corredor"],["renovate","reformar"]]}]},{"tag":"Compreensão","title":"Did you understand?","blocks":[{"type":"tfng","title":"","items":[{"q":"The park reopened on Monday.","ans":"T","why":"reopened Monday."},{"q":"Children dislike the new swings.","ans":"F","why":"love playing."},{"q":"The mayor suggested adding benches.","ans":"T","why":"putting more benches."}]},{"type":"mcq","title":"Vocabulary in context","items":[{"q":"“bench” = ?","opts":["banco de praça","banco financeiro","balcão"],"ans":0,"why":"bench."},{"q":"“renovate” = ?","opts":["reformar","vender","pintar"],"ans":0,"why":"renovate."}]}]},{"tag":"Gramática","title":"Verb + -ing","blocks":[{"type":"table","head":["Verbo","Exemplo"],"rows":[["enjoy","**enjoy walking**"],["keep","**keep running**"],["love / like","**love playing**"],["suggest","**suggest putting**"],["avoid","**avoid sitting**"],["finish","**finish renovating**"]],"cap":"Verb + -ing"},{"type":"box","kind":"look","t":"Regra","body":"Depois de **enjoy, avoid, finish, keep, suggest, mind** use sempre **-ing**."}]},{"tag":"Prática","title":"Practice","blocks":[{"type":"gap","title":"Complete the sentences","bank":null,"items":[{"s":"I enjoy ___ . (walk)","a":"walking","why":"enjoy + -ing."},{"s":"She avoids ___ there. (sit)","a":"sitting","why":"dobra t."},{"s":"They finished ___ . (renovate)","a":"renovating","why":"finish + -ing."},{"s":"He suggested ___ benches. (put)","a":"putting","why":"dobra t."}]},{"type":"match","title":"Match the word to its meaning","pairs":[["swing","balanço"],["bench","banco"],["jogger","corredor"],["renovate","reformar"],["reopen","reabrir"]]},{"type":"order","title":"Put the words in order","items":[{"words":["you","enjoy","running","here","Do"],"ans":"Do you enjoy running here","pt":"Gosta de correr aqui?"},{"words":["exercising","Did","you","finish"],"ans":"Did you finish exercising","pt":"Terminou o exercício?"}]}]},{"tag":"Vocabulário","title":"Words and expressions","blocks":[{"type":"vocab","items":[{"w":"renovate","pos":"word","pt":"reformar","ex":"Renovate the café.","expt":"Reforme o café."},{"w":"reopen","pos":"word","pt":"reabrir","ex":"The park reopened.","expt":"O parque reabriu."},{"w":"sandbox","pos":"word","pt":"caixa de areia","ex":"Kids in the sandbox.","expt":"Crianças na caixa de areia."},{"w":"footpath","pos":"word","pt":"trilha","ex":"A narrow footpath.","expt":"Uma trilha estreita."},{"w":"sculpture","pos":"word","pt":"escultura","ex":"A bronze sculpture.","expt":"Uma escultura de bronze."},{"w":"construction","pos":"word","pt":"construction","ex":"obra","expt":"A construction site."},{"w":"cement","pos":"word","pt":"cement","ex":"cimento","expt":"A bag of cement."},{"w":"scaffolding","pos":"word","pt":"scaffolding","ex":"andaime","expt":"Metal scaffolding."},{"w":"tulips","pos":"word","pt":"tulips","ex":"tulipas","expt":"Red tulips."},{"w":"flowerbed","pos":"word","pt":"flowerbed","ex":"canteiro","expt":"A new flowerbed."},{"w":"bandstand","pos":"word","pt":"bandstand","ex":"coreto","expt":"An old bandstand."},{"w":"ice cream cart","pos":"word","pt":"ice cream cart","ex":"carrinho de sorvete","expt":"An ice cream cart."},{"w":"pavilion","pos":"word","pt":"pavilion","ex":"pavilhão","expt":"A park pavilion."},{"w":"paved","pos":"word","pt":"paved","ex":"pavimentado","expt":"A paved path."},{"w":"volunteer crew","pos":"word","pt":"volunteer crew","ex":"equipe voluntária","expt":"A volunteer crew."},{"w":"ribbon cutting","pos":"word","pt":"ribbon cutting","ex":"inauguração","expt":"A ribbon cutting."}]},{"type":"box","kind":"culture","t":"Expressões desta aula","body":["**Do you enjoy running here?** — Gosta de correr aqui?","**Yes, I keep coming every day.** — Sim, venho todo dia.","**Did you finish exercising?** — Terminou o exercício?","**Where there’s a will, there’s a way.** — Querer é poder.","**Rome wasn’t built in a day.** — Roma não foi construída em um dia.","**I’m on it.** — Estou cuidando disso.","**That’s news to me.** — Isso é novidade para mim."]}]},{"tag":"Verbos","title":"Verbs in focus","blocks":[{"type":"verbs","items":[{"v":"dance","pt":"dançar","forms":[["I / you / we / they dance","I dance salsa."],["he / she / it dances","She dances well."]]}]},{"type":"table","head":["Phrasal verb","Significado","Exemplo"],"rows":[["**hang out**","passar tempo","We hang out at the park. — Passamos tempo no parque."]],"cap":"Phrasal verbs"}]},{"tag":"Escuta e diálogo","title":"At the park","blocks":[{"type":"dialog","title":"At the park","lines":[["Ana","Do you enjoy running here?","Gosta de correr aqui?"],["Leo","Yes, I keep coming every day.","Sim, venho todo dia."],["Ana","Did you finish exercising?","Terminou o exercício?"],["Leo","Yes. Let’s avoid sitting on the wet bench.","Sim. Vamos evitar sentar no banco molhado."]]},{"type":"pron","title":"Pronúncia: Terminações do passado /t/ /d/ /ɪd/","items":[{"label":"Terminações do passado /t/ /d/ /ɪd/","note":"Pratique em voz alta.","words":[]}]}]},{"tag":"Fala","title":"Speaking","blocks":[{"type":"speak","title":"Speaking","prompts":[{"q":"Say what you enjoy doing.","pt":"Diga.","model":"I enjoy walking."},{"q":"Say what you avoid.","pt":"Diga.","model":"I avoid eating late."},{"q":"Say what you keep doing.","pt":"Diga.","model":"I keep studying English."}]}]},{"tag":"Escrita","title":"Writing","blocks":[{"type":"write","task":"Write 5 sentences with verb + -ing.","model":"I enjoy walking in the park. She keeps running every day. We finished renovating the café. I avoid sitting on wet benches. He suggested putting more benches.","checklist":["Usei **5 verbos + -ing**","Usei **dobra consoante**","Frases claras"],"words":"5 frases"}]},{"tag":"Revisão e exame","title":"Review · Exam strategy · Teacher’s note","blocks":[{"type":"mcq","title":"Check yourself","items":[{"q":"What does “swing” mean?","opts":["banco","balanço","reformar"],"ans":1,"why":"**swing** = balanço."},{"q":"What does “bench” mean?","opts":["corredor","reabrir","banco"],"ans":2,"why":"**bench** = banco."},{"q":"What does “jogger” mean?","opts":["corredor","reformar","caixa de areia"],"ans":0,"why":"**jogger** = corredor."},{"q":"What does “renovate” mean?","opts":["reabrir","reformar","trilha"],"ans":1,"why":"**renovate** = reformar."}]},{"type":"box","kind":"exam","t":"Estratégia para as provas","body":["Treine esta habilidade com o formato de tarefas curtas das provas (TOEFL/IELTS).","Leia o enunciado primeiro e procure as palavras-chave."]},{"type":"box","kind":"teach","t":"Nota para o futuro professor","body":["Use exemplos reais da vida dos alunos e peça frases próprias.","Corrija o erro mais frequente da aula em grupo, sem expor o aluno.","Retome o conteúdo na aula seguinte com um exercício curto."]}]}]}